# 🛒 E-Commerce AI Support Chatbot
### Amazon / Flipkart Style AI Customer Support Assistant

An intelligent AI-powered support system inspired by Amazon and Flipkart customer service that helps customers resolve issues instantly through conversational AI.

The chatbot handles order support, refunds, recommendations, FAQs, payment issues, and escalation workflows using FastAPI + LangGraph + RAG architecture.

---

# 🚀 Project Overview

## AI Shopping Support & Order Assistant

This project provides an AI chatbot capable of assisting customers with:

- Order tracking
- Returns and refunds
- Product questions
- Payment support
- Delivery updates
- Multilingual conversations

